<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 581 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 581 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish money market dealer banks bid for 251 million zlotys worth of the National Bank of Poland's 91-day bills and 330 million of 182-day bills against a 100 million and 300 million zloty offer respectively.</p>
<p>Full details of the tender are likely to be announced around 1300 local time (1200 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
